WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.043
[MUSIC]

00:00:05.043 --> 00:00:08.310
What we're trying to do is help people
understand that everyone's the hero in

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:09.500
their own story.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:11.040
And the more you understand that,

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:14.950
the more you can internalize that belief,
I think the better leader you can be.

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:20.500
To be an effective leader, you need to
both be able to understand yourself in

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:23.690
a deep way understand how other
people experience themselves.

00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:28.010
And then all those things together will
allow you to create a story to craft

00:00:28.010 --> 00:00:28.960
the persona.

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:32.044
It allows you to lead the team or
the organization more effectively.

00:00:32.044 --> 00:00:40.030
[MUSIC]

